<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Epoxy Flooring & Basement Waterproofing - Premium Local Service</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS via CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Custom CSS for any additional styles -->
    <style>
        /* We can add custom styles here if needed, but we'll try to stick to Tailwind */
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-900 antialiased">
    <!-- Top Announcement Bar -->
    <div class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-4 py-2 text-sm flex items-center justify-between sm:flex-row sm:justify-start">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3M6 16h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Emergency Waterproofing Available 24/7</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:flex sm:items-center space-x-4">
            <span>Serving Austin, TX & Surrounding Areas</span>
            <a href="tel:+15550192834" class="text-amber-200 hover:text-amber-100">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-0.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 015.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.948V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 5 16.284 5 11V5a2 2 0 012-2z" />
                </svg>
                (555) 019-2834
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <button id="mobile-menu-button" class="md:hidden p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-500">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" />
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Menu (Hidden by default) -->
    <div id="mobile-menu" class="md:hidden bg-amber-600">
        <nav class="px-4 py-3 space-y-2">
            <a href="#services" class="block text-amber-200 hover:text-amber-100 px-3 py-2 rounded">Services</a>
            <a href="#before-after" class="block text-amber-200 hover:text-amber-100 px-3 py-2 rounded">Before/After</a>
            <a href="#cost-calculator" class="block text-amber-200 hover:text-amber-100 px-3 py-2 rounded">Cost Calculator</a>
            <a href="#reviews" class="block text-amber-200 hover:text-amber-100 px-3 py-2 rounded">Reviews</a>
            <a href="#about" class="block text-amber-200 hover:text-amber-100 px-3 py-2 rounded">About</a>
            <a href="#" class="block bg-amber-500 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded">Get Free Quote</a>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Sticky Header -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex items-center justify-between h-16">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3M6 16h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
                <span class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-900">EpoxyGuard Pros</span>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-8">
                <a href="#services" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium">Services</a>
                <a href="#before-after" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium">Before/After</a>
                <a href="#cost-calculator" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium">Cost Calculator</a>
                <a href="#reviews" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium">Reviews</a>
                <a href="#about" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium">About</a>
            </nav>
            <a href="#cost-calculator" class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors">
                Get Free Quote
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative bg-gray-50 py-20">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:gap-12">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
                        Protect Your Basement. Elevate Your Floors.
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">
                        Commercial-grade Epoxy Flooring & Lifetime-Guaranteed Basement Waterproofing. Built to last a lifetime.
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <button id="primary-cta" class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors font-medium flex items-center space-x-2">
                            Get Instant Quote (Takes 60 Seconds)
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 5l7 7-7 7M5 5l7 7-7 7" />
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                        <a href="tel:+15550192834" class="border border-amber-600 text-amber-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-50 transition-colors flex items-center space-x-2">
                            Call (555) 019-2834
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-0.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 015.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.948V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 5 16.284 5 11V5a2 2 0 012-2z" />
                            </svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="lg:mt-16 lg:-mr-12">
                    <!-- Lead Capture Form Floating Box -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl p-6 w-full max-w-sm">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Get Your Free Quote in 3 Simple Steps</h2>
                        <form id="lead-form" class="space-y-4">
                            <!-- Step 1: Service Needed -->
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What service do you need?</label>
                                <select class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500">
                                    <option value="">Select Service</option>
                                    <option value="epoxy">Metallic & Decorative Epoxy Flooring</option>
                                    <option value="waterproofing">Basement Waterproofing</option>
                                    <option value="both">Both Epoxy & Waterproofing</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Step 2: Area & Zip -->
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Area Size (sq.ft)</label>
                                    <input type="number" min="100" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500" placeholder="e.g., 500">
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Zip Code</label>
                                    <input type="text" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500" placeholder="e.g., 78701">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Step 3: Contact Info -->
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Your Name</label>
                                    <input type="text" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500" placeholder="First Last">
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Phone Number</label>
                                    <input type="tel" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-amber-500 focus:border-amber-500" placeholder="(555) 123-4567">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-amber-600 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors font-medium mt-2">
                                Get My Free Quote
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Trust Badges -->
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center mt-12 space-x-6">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3M6 16h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">Licensed & Insured</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.768 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.768 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.768 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.768 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.768 0V14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1V9a2 2 0 00-4 0v5h-1V4.697z" />
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">500+ 5-Star Reviews</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3M6 16h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">Lifetime Warranty</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3M6 16h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">0% Financing Available</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Service Dual-Toggle / Dual Card Section -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-12">Our Core Services</h2>
            <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
                <!-- Epoxy Flooring Card -->
                <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3M6 16h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Metallic & Decorative Epoxy Flooring</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Transform your garage, patio, or commercial space with high-gloss, durable epoxy coatings that resist chemicals, stains, and wear.</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-2 mb-4">
                                <li>High-gloss finish available in multiple colors</li>
                                <li>Chemical and stain resistant</li>
                                <li>Seamless and easy to clean</li>
                                <li>15-year residential warranty</li>
                                <li>Anti-slip additives available</li>
                            </ul>
                            <a href="#cost-calculator" class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors w-full text-center">
                                Request Free Estimate
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Basement Waterproofing Card -->
                <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
                    <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3M6 16h12a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Heavy-Duty Basement Waterproofing</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Protect your home from water damage with interior drain tile systems, sump pumps, and wall crack repair solutions.</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-2 mb-4">
                                <li>Interior drain tile systems</li>
                                <li>Sump pump installation and backup</li>
                                <li>Wall crack and joint repair</li>
                                <li>Lifetime transferable warranty</li>
                                <li>Mold and mildew prevention</li>
                            </ul>
                            <a href="#cost-calculator" class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors w-full text-center">
                                Request Free Estimate
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive Before/After Slider -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-12">See the Transformation</h2>
            <div class="relative">
                <!-- Before Image (left side) -->
                <div class="w-full h-96 bg-gray-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x600/6b7280/ffffff?text=Before:+Cracked+%26+Wet+Basement+Floor" alt="Before: Cracked and wet basement floor" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                </div>
                <!-- After Image (right side, initially hidden) -->
                <div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-96 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/800x600/10b981/ffffff?text=After:+High-Gloss+Epoxy+Floor" alt="After: High-gloss epoxy floor" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    <!-- Slider Handle -->
                    <div id="slider-handle" class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-1 bg-amber-600 cursor-col-resize"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-center text-gray-500">Drag the slider to see the transformation</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Instant Cost Calculator -->
    <section id="cost-calculator" class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-12">Instant Cost Estimate</h2>
            <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Get an instant price range for your epoxy flooring or basement waterproofing project in seconds.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
                <form id="calculator-form" class="space-y-6">
                    <!-- Project Type -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Project Type</label>
                        <div class="flex space-x-4">
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <input type="radio" name="projectType" value="epoxy" checked class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-600">
                                <span>Epoxy Flooring</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <input type="radio" name="projectType" value="waterproofing" class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-600">
                                <span>Basement Waterproofing</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <input type="radio" name="projectType" value="both" class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-600">
                                <span>Both</span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Area Size -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Area Size (sq.ft)</label>
                        <div class="flex items-center">
                            <input type="range" id="area-slider" min="200" max="3000" value="500" class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full">
                            <span id="area-value" class="ml-4 text-amber-600 font-medium min-w-[4ch]">500</span> sq.ft
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Floor Condition -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2">Floor Condition</label>
                        <div class="flex space-x-4">
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <input type="radio" name="condition" value="good" checked class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-600">
                                <span>Good</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <input type="radio" name="condition" value="minor" class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-600">
                                <span>Minor Cracks</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <input type="radio" name="condition" value="severe" class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-600">
                                <span>Severe Water Damage</span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Estimated Cost -->
                    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Estimated Cost Range</h3>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600" id="cost-range">$1,500 - $3,000</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">*Final price determined after on-site inspection</p>
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full mt-6 bg-amber-600 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors font-medium">
                            Lock in Your Discount Rate & Schedule On-Site Inspection
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Proof & Reviews Section -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-12">Trusted by Homeowners & Businesses</h2>
            <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
                <!-- Google Review Badge -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl text-center shadow">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-amber-600 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.568 8.332 1.151-6.064 5.828 1.48 8.279-7.416-3.967-7.417 3.967 1.481-8.279-6.064-5.828 8.332-1.151z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span>Google Reviews</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-amber-600 mb-2">4.9</div>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">★★★★★ (320+ reviews)</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Video Testimonial Placeholder -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Video Testimonials</h3>
                    <div class="aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 5l6.389 4.368a2 2 0 010 3.264l-6.389 4.368a2 2 0 01-2 0V5zm0 0l6.389-4.368a2 2 0 000-3.264l-6.389-4.368a2 2 0 00-2 0v14a2 2 0 002 0z" />
                        </svg>
                        <p class="text-gray-500">Click to play video testimonial</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Customer Quote -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Customer Quote</h3>
                    <p class="italic text-gray-600 mb-4">"EpoxyGuard Pros transformed our basement from a damp, unusable space into a beautiful, dry living area. The team was professional, and the lifetime warranty gives us peace of mind."</p>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/40x40/6b7280/ffffff?text=JD" alt="John D." class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full">
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">John D., Austin, TX</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Basement Waterproofing</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQs & Edu-Section -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-12">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <!-- Accordion Item 1 -->
                <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 bg-gray-50 cursor-pointer" id="faq-1">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900">How long does epoxy flooring installation take?</h3>
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200" id="faq-1-icon" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden p-5 text-gray-600" id="faq-1-answer">
                        Most residential epoxy flooring projects are completed in 1-2 days. The process includes surface preparation, primer application, epoxy coating, and top seal. Larger commercial projects may take longer depending on size and complexity.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Accordion Item 2 -->
                <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg mt-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 bg-gray-50 cursor-pointer" id="faq-2">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900">Does basement waterproofing come with a warranty?</h3>
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200" id="faq-2-icon" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden p-5 text-gray-600" id="faq-2-answer">
                        Yes! Our basement waterproofing systems come with a lifetime transferable warranty that covers both parts and labor. This warranty is backed by our 20+ years of experience and is designed to give you long-term peace of mind.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Accordion Item 3 -->
                <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg mt-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 bg-gray-50 cursor-pointer" id="faq-3">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900">What options do I have if my basement is actively flooding?</h3>
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200" id="faq-3-icon" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden p-5 text-gray-600" id="faq-3-answer">
                        For active flooding, we recommend an immediate emergency response. We offer 24/7 emergency waterproofing services that include interior drainage systems, sump pump installation, and water extraction to stop the flooding and prevent further damage.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

